OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle due in
OL,4,Acourt after arrest on charge relating
OL,5,Ato child sex abuse material
OL,6,
OL,7,FThomas Markle, the father of Meghan,
OL,8,FDuchess of Sussex, has been charged
OL,9,Fover the possession of child sex abuse
OL,10,Fmaterial
OL,12,FHe is due to appear in court in Tampa,
OL,13,FFlorida, later at about 18:30 GMT
OL,14,F(13:30 ET)
OL,16,FMarkle was arrested after the FBI
OL,17,Fsearched two Los Angeles-area storage
OL,18,Funits he rented for almost 20 years -
OL,19,Fhere's more from the Department of
OL,20,FJustice statement
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
