OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle due in
OL,4,Acourt after arrest on charge relating
OL,5,Ato child sex abuse material
OL,6,
OL,7,FImages published by news outlets
OL,8,Falongside reports of the 82-year-old's
OL,9,Farrest appear to show him in handcuffs
OL,10,Fsurrounded by FBI personnel
OL,12,FMarkle has previously denied
OL,13,Fallegations of possessing images of
OL,14,Fchild sex abuse, calling the claims
OL,15,F"sick lies"
OL,17,FThe duchess has been estranged from her
OL,18,Ffather since 2018 - in a statement last
OL,19,Fmonth, the wife of Prince Harry said:
OL,20,F"I am deeply distressed... my thoughts
OL,21,Fare with any children who may have been
OL,22,Fharmed"
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
